    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBowasi wasesuka esiya enkundleni, wahlala phansi khona. Kwasekudlula isihlobo leso esiseduze ayekhulume ngaso. UBowasi wasesithi: Akuphambukele lapha, mngane, uhlale phansi lapha. Wasephambuka, wahlala phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebiza abadala bomuzi abalitshumi, wathi kubo: Ake lihlale phansi lapha. Balebehlala phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kulesosihlobo: UNawomi osebuyile elizweni laseMowabi uthengisa isiqinti selizwe esasingesikaElimeleki isihlobo sethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho ngithande ukukutshela ngakho ngithi: Sithenge phambi kwalaba abahlezi lapha laphambi kwabadala babantu bakithi. Uba ungasihlenga, sihlenge. Kodwa uba kukwahlula, ungitshele, ukuba lami ngazi, ngoba kakho omunye ngaphandle kwakho ongasihlenga; mina ngiza emva kwakho. Yena wathi: Ngizasihlenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBowasi wasesithi kuye: Mhla uthenga lesosiqinti kuNawomi, uzakuthenga loRuthe waseMowabi ongumfelwakazi, ukuze umise ibizo lomuyi elifeni lakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesosihlobo sasesisithi: Ngingeke ngazihlengela sona, funa ngone ilifa lami. Zithathele wena ilungelo lami, ngoba mina kangilamandla okusihlenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulezonsuku zakuqala lapho kwakuhlengwa loba kusenanwa impahla, kwakungumkhuba ukuba umuntu othengisayo akhuphe inyathelo lakhe, alinike lowo othengayo. Le yayiyindlela yokuqinisa koIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 25:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke kwathi ukuba lesosihlobo sithi kuBowasi: Zithengele sona wena; sasesikhumula inyathelo laso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBowasi wasesithi kwabadala lakubo bonke abantu: Lina lingofakazi lamhla bokuba ngithengile kuNawomi konke okwakungokukaElimeleki lokwakungokukaKiliyoni lokukaMaheloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LoRuthe waseMowabi, umfelwakazi kaMaheloni laye ngimthengile ukuba abe ngumkami, ukuba ngimise ibizo lomuyi elifeni lakhe, ukuba ibizo lakhe lingapheli phakathi kwabafowabo lenkundleni yakibo. Lina lingofakazi lamhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.5+DEU.25.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 25:5–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu ababesenkundleni labadala bathi: Thina singofakazi; kungathi iNkosi ingamenza lo owesifazana ozayo emzini wakho abe njengoRaheli loLeya abayakhayo indlu kaIsrayeli bendawonye. Kungathi ungaphumelela eEfratha, ube lodumo eBetlehema,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 29:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lendlu yakho ibe njengendlu kaPerezi uTamari amzalele uJuda, ngabantwana iNkosi ezakukunika bona ngalo owesifazana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.38.27+GEN.38.28+GEN.38.29+GEN.38.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 38:27–30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uBowasi wasemthatha uRuthe, waba ngumkakhe. INkosi yambusisa, wasethatha isisu, wazala indodana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abesifazana bathi kuNawomi: Kayibongwe iNkosi engakutshiyanga lamhla ungelasihlobo. Kungathi ibizo lomuyi lingahlala likhona koIsrayeli! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lumntwana uzakukunika ukusila okutsha, akondle ebudaleni bakho, ngoba umalokazana wakho okuthandayo, omkhulu kuwe kulamadodana ayisikhombisa, umzele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi wasemthatha umntwana, wamgona esifubeni sakhe, waba ngumlizane wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abesifazana abakhelene laye bamutha ibizo bathi nguObedi besithi: UNawomi uselendodana. Nguye owaba nguyise kaJese, uyise kaDavida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
